<section class="map-area"><div id="map"></div><div class="map-title"><h1 id="map-name">Untitled project</h1><p id="map-subtitle">A clear view of all your spatial data.</p></div><div class="basemap-picker"><label for="basemap">View</label><select id="basemap" aria-label="Basemap"><option value="street">Street</option><option value="satellite">Satellite</option><option value="hybrid">Hybrid</option></select></div><div class="map-tools"><button id="mobile-layers" class="square" aria-label="Toggle layers">▱</button><button id="fit" class="square" aria-label="Fit all layers" title="Fit all layers">⤢</button><button id="locate" class="square" aria-label="Show my location" title="Show my location">◎</button><button id="identify" class="square" aria-label="Feature information" title="Feature information" aria-pressed="false">i</button><button id="help" class="square" aria-label="Import help" title="Import help">?</button></div><section id="feature-info" class="feature-info" aria-label="Feature information panel" hidden><div class="info-heading"><strong id="feature-info-title">Feature information</strong><button id="close-info" aria-label="Close feature information">×</button></div><div id="feature-info-content">Click a point, line or shape on the map to inspect its attributes.</div></section><div id="empty-map"><span class="empty-icon">▱</span><h2>Your map starts here.</h2><p>Add a survey, a boundary, or an entire project.<br>We’ll help put every layer in the right place.</p><button id="add-files" class="primary">＋ Add your first layers</button><small>Review coordinates before anything is saved.</small></div><div class="map-bottom"><div class="basemap-label"><span class="status-dot"></span> <span id="basemap-name">OpenStreetMap</span> <span class="divider">|</span> WGS 84 display</div><span id="coordinates">Move across the map to see coordinates</span></div></section></main>
